
A few projects, mostly tools I wrote for my own use and later cleaned up
enough to share. This page is written in [txt2tags https://txt2tags.org/].

Projects are grouped by topic below.


= Writing & reading =

WrithDeck (a writerdeck editor) and its many ports, Zettelium (Zettelkasten-style
note-taking), and the KOReader and SciTE plugins.

[See the projects writing.html]


= Music & audio =

Two VST/AU emulators (Roland D-110 and JV-880), sequencers (Hexacorde, Nonet), an ABC
generator, a MIDI to Furnace exporter and Casio MIDI banks.

[See the projects audio.html]


= Tabletop RPG & generation =

Sparkwyrd (a random text generator), a roguelike (Escapades) and a small Yi Jing app.

[See the projects rpg.html]


= txt2tags tools =

Ports of txt2tags to several languages and a script for QOwnNotes.

[See the projects tools.html]


= Graphics & 3D =

Vector World, a retro low-poly 3D world in the style of 16-bit demos.

[See the projects graphics.html]


= Games =

Forth for TIC-80, a strategy game (Halebarde et Gonfanon) and tic-tac-toe for Uxn.

[See the projects games.html]



